</figure>
<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section reports the complete set of metrics of our evaluation scripts on PrivatePower, complementing the representative results shown in the main text. Tables <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ C.1 Per-𝜎 Results on PrivatePower ‣ Appendix C Additional Results on Model Utility ‣ DP-aware AdaLN-Zero: Taming Conditioning-Induced Heavy-Tailed Gradients in Differentially Private Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> and <a href="#A3.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ C.1 Per-𝜎 Results on PrivatePower ‣ Appendix C Additional Results on Model Utility ‣ DP-aware AdaLN-Zero: Taming Conditioning-Induced Heavy-Tailed Gradients in Differentially Private Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> summarize forecasting and interpolation/imputation performance, respectively. Figure <a href="#A3.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ C.1 Per-𝜎 Results on PrivatePower ‣ Appendix C Additional Results on Model Utility ‣ DP-aware AdaLN-Zero: Taming Conditioning-Induced Heavy-Tailed Gradients in Differentially Private Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> shows the per-example gradient-norm distributions observed during DP-SGD training.</p>
</div>
</section>
